---
layout: base.njk
title: Favorites
description: The products we use and trust, room by room.
permalink: /favorites/
---
<main><section class="page-head"><div class="wrap">
  <h1>My favorites</h1>
  <p class="section-intro">The products we use and trust, organized by room. You don’t need all of them. Start with what you can afford, and remember the free swaps come first.</p>
  <nav class="chips" aria-label="Rooms">
    {% for r in site.rooms %}{% if collections.favorites | where("room", r) | length %}<a href="#{{ r | slugify }}">{{ r }}</a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </nav>
  <div class="rooms">
  {% for r in site.rooms %}{% set items = collections.favorites | where("room", r) | byOrder %}{% if items | length %}
    <div class="room" id="{{ r | slugify }}">
      <h3>{{ r }}</h3>
      <ul>{% for f in items %}{% include "favorite.njk" %}{% endfor %}</ul>
    </div>
  {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
</div></section></main>
